{"evidence_id": "EV-20261124-140458-21cf5a06-030", "run_id": "RUN-20261124-140458-21cf5a06", "rule_id": "R-PERM-02", "kind": "b1_response", "layer": "STATIC", "origin": "b_channel", "location": "B1 复核", "raw_snippet": "{\"verdict\": \"确认可疑\", \"reason\": \"命中位于 RecordingService（非交互的 Service 组件），且不只是字段/import 声明，而是存在 new-instance 加 invoke-direct 构造 MediaRecorder 并调用 setAudioSource/setOutputFormat/setAudioEncoder 等实际敏感 API 调用，不落入误报口径。\", \"observation\": \"多个命中点实为同一条录音调用链的不同环节（构造、setAudioSource、setOutputFormat、setAudioEncoder），组件明确为 Service 而非 Activity；后续还有 iput-object 存入 recorder 字段与 iget-object 取用，说明对象被真正使用而非仅声明。\"}", "source_file": "bad03.apk", "source_sha256": "21cf5a06cc615b6e8ce71b66dbcda9386a136f63d861fcc258a195b98c4728aa", "rule_pack": "0.1.6", "created": "2026-11-24T06:05:19Z", "raw_response_path": "raw/EV-20261124-140458-21cf5a06-030.txt", "raw_response_sha256": "3c61968d38a88ffca3ca5b3ac4fcb977121e94000b761ae99b615a6cfec69c34", "prompt_version": "b1-v0.4", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "verdict": "确认可疑", "observation": "多个命中点实为同一条录音调用链的不同环节（构造、setAudioSource、setOutputFormat、setAudioEncoder），组件明确为 Service 而非 Activity；后续还有 iput-object 存入 recorder 字段与 iget-object 取用，说明对象被真正使用而非仅声明。", "input_sha256": "60fa741455716993bf0e859ea2a401bdd138037fd1fb5d7708ec0e55a4875052", "injection_flag": false}
{"evidence_id": "EV-20261124-140458-21cf5a06-031", "run_id": "RUN-20261124-140458-21cf5a06", "rule_id": "R-CODE-01", "kind": "b1_response", "layer": "STATIC", "origin": "b_channel", "location": "B1 复核", "raw_snippet": "{\"verdict\": \"确认可疑\", \"reason\": \"命中不是单纯的类名字符串，而是完整的 DexClassLoader 实例化（new-instance）、构造调用（invoke-direct <init>）以及随后的 loadClass 调用链，具备明确的动态代码加载调用上下文，超出'仅字符串出现类名'的误报口径。\", \"observation\": \"三个片段构成连续调用链：构造 DexClassLoader 后立即以常量字符串 \\\"com.synth.bad03.plugin.EntryPoint\\\" 调用 loadClass，属于典型的动态加载并执行外部 dex 类的结构。\"}", "source_file": "bad03.apk", "source_sha256": "21cf5a06cc615b6e8ce71b66dbcda9386a136f63d861fcc258a195b98c4728aa", "rule_pack": "0.1.6", "created": "2026-11-24T06:05:26Z", "raw_response_path": "raw/EV-20261124-140458-21cf5a06-031.txt", "raw_response_sha256": "140d278089638d55885245b2422f2bdf29ba2ad2472055bffc3cbc6db0dd9b08", "prompt_version": "b1-v0.4", "model": "mimo-v2.6-flash", "verdict": "确认可疑", "observation": "三个片段构成连续调用链：构造 DexClassLoader 后立即以常量字符串 \"com.synth.bad03.plugin.EntryPoint\" 调用 loadClass，属于典型的动态加载并执行外部 dex 类的结构。", "input_sha256": "f907fc213607f34d2566e26f2d6ca7c59a97fb2c897a22c090ee454fa6f5bd44", "injection_flag": false}
